        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "What both challenges have in common is that PE EVSE manufacturers and OEMs initially provide the certificate chains for the leaf certificates for their devices/EVs. The chains include the root CA certificate(s).",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                1360,
                1054,
                1439
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    68.0,
                    1360.0
                ],
                [
                    1054.0,
                    1360.0
                ],
                [
                    1054.0,
                    1439.0
                ],
                [
                    68.0,
                    1439.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For challenge 1, PE EVSE manufacturers and OEMs are also installing and maintaining the trust anchors for the leaf certificates that their devices/EVs are allowed to work with and limiting the usage to those certificates.",
